  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways to Employment in Palestine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The Pathways to Employment (PEP) project&lt;/b&gt; aims at empowering youth in Palestine: young people develop into active and critical citizens, ready for local and global challenges through improved education, training, guidance and access to employment.&amp;nbsp;The project&apos;s&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;specific objective is that more young women and men in Palestine are employed in decent work conditions or have their own income-generating business :&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Result 1 - Increased access to Skills Development through investing in and upgrading TVET infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Result 2 - Improved Employability through Equitable Access to Skills Development.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span&gt;Result 3&lt;b&gt; -&lt;/b&gt; Employment Opportunities for Young Women and Men through Entrepreneurship Promotion and Business Development Support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
